  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusion of SRHR in teachers training curriculm</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The organsiatin will advocate for a curriculum review for teacher trainings in order to include a stronger focus on Sexual and Reproductive Health Rights (SRHR). Teachers will be trained in SRHR.</narrative>
  </description>
